ceras son espacio público: deben quedar libres, parejas y seguras, sobre todo para niños, adultos mayores, y personas con discapacidad.", "pause": 0.3, "start": 23.88, "end": 32.67, "words": [{"w": "Las", "s": 23.88, "e": 24.06}, {"w": "aceras", "s": 24.06, "e": 24.46}, {"w": "son", "s": 24.46, "e": 24.68}, {"w": "espacio", "s": 24.68, "e": 25.06}, {"w": "público.", "s": 25.06, "e": 25.52}, {"w": "Deben", "s": 25.86, "e": 26.18}, {"w": "quedar", "s": 26.18, "e": 26.4}, {"w": "libres,", "s": 26.4, "e": 27.04}, {"w": "parejas", "s": 27.16, "e": 27.54}, {"w": "y", "s": 27.54, "e": 27.7}, {"w": "seguras,", "s": 27.7, "e": 28.2}, {"w": "sobre", "s": 28.48, "e": 28.64}, {"w": "todo", "s": 28.64, "e": 28.94}, {"w": "para", "s": 28.94, "e": 29.2}, {"w": "niños,", "s": 29.2, "e": 29.52}, {"w": "adultos", "s": 29.8, "e": 30.22}, {"w": "mayores", "s": 30.22, "e": 30.72}, {"w": "y", "s": 30.72, "e": 30.98}, {"w": "personas", "s": 30.98, "e": 31.4}, {"w": "con", "s": 31.4, "e": 31.66}, {"w": "discapacidad.", "s": 31.66, "e": 32.44}]}, {"scene": "mito", "text": "Pero romper la rampa a escondidas, o dañarle el carro, no arregla nada. Convierte un problema en una pelea.", "pause": 0.3, "start": 32.97, "end": 38.99, "words": [{"w": "Pero", "s": 32.97, "e": 33.17}, {"w": "romper", "s": 33.17, "e": 33.57}, {"w": "la", "s": 33.57, "e": 33.67}, {"w": "rampa", "s": 33.67, "e": 34.01}, {"w": "escondidas", "s": 34.01, "e": 34.69}, {"w": "o", "s": 34.69, "e": 34.97}, {"w": "dañarle", "s": 34.97, "e": 35.41}, {"w": "el", "s": 35.41, "e": 35.57}, {"w": "carro", "s": 35.57, "e": 35.85}, {"w": "no", "s": 35.85, "e": 36.13}, {"w": "arregla", "s": 36.13, "e": 36.55}, {"w": "nada,", "s": 36.55, "e": 36.81}, {"w": "convierte", "s": 37.13, "e": 37.51}, {"w": "un", "s": 37.51, "e": 37.69}, {"w": "problema", "s": 37.69, "e": 38.11}, {"w": "en", "s": 38.11, "e": 38.29}, {"w": "una", "s": 38.29, "e": 38.43}, {"w": "pelea.", "s": 38.43, "e": 38.87}]}, {"scene": "pasos", "text": "Lo que funciona: primero, hablar y buscar opciones, como una rampa que no corte el paso.", "pause": 0.2, "start": 39.29, "end": 44.5, "words": [{"w": "Lo", "s": 39.29, "e": 39.47}, {"w": "que", "s": 39.47, "e": 39.59}, {"w": "funciona,", "s": 39.59, "e": 40.07}, {"w": "primero", "s": 40.41, "e": 40.71}, {"w": "hablar", "s": 40.71, "e": 41.23}, {"w": "y", "s": 41.23, "e": 41.47}, {"w": "buscar", "s": 41.47, "e": 41.69}, {"w": "opciones", "s": 41.69, "e": 42.31}, {"w": "como", "s": 42.31, "e": 42.65}, {"w": "una", "s": 42.65, "e": 42.81}, {"w": "rampa", "s": 42.81, "e": 43.25}, {"w": "que", "s": 43.25, "e": 43.37}, {"w": "no", "s": 43.37, "e": 43.53}, {"w": "corte", "s": 43.53, "e": 43.91}, {"w": "el", "s": 43.91, "e": 43.99}, {"w": "paso.", "s": 43.99, "e": 44.23}]}, {"scene": "pasos", "text": "Segundo, llevar el caso al patronato, para un acuerdo en toda la calle.", "pause": 0.2, "start": 44.7, "end": 48.65, "words": [{"w": "Segundo,", "s": 44.7, "e": 45.22}, {"w": "llevar", "s": 45.36, "e": 45.54}, {"w": "el", "s": 45.54, "e": 45.72}, {"w": "caso", "s": 45.72, "e": 46.0}, {"w": "al", "s": 46.0, "e": 46.16}, {"w": "patronato", "s": 46.16, "e": 46.76}, {"w": "para", "s": 46.76, "e": 47.1}, {"w": "un", "s": 47.1, "e": 47.22}, {"w": "acuerdo", "s": 47.22, "e": 47.56}, {"w": "en", "s": 47.56, "e": 47.78}, {"w": "toda", "s": 47.78, "e": 47.92}, {"w": "la", "s": 47.92, "e": 48.12}, {"w": "calle.", "s": 48.12, "e": 48.42}]}, {"scene": "pasos", "text": "Y tercero, buscar orientación en CONAFEPH antes de que el conflicto crezca.", "say": "Y tercero, buscar orientación en Conafép antes de que el conflicto crezca.", "pause": 0.3, "start": 48.85, "end": 53.24, "words": [{"w": "y,", "s": 48.85, "e": 49.01}, {"w": "tercero,", "s": 49.07, "e": 49.53}, {"w": "buscar", "s": 49.67, "e": 49.87}, {"w": "orientación", "s": 49.87, "e": 50.63}, {"w": "en", "s": 50.63, "e": 50.79}, {"w": "Conafep", "s": 50.79, "e": 51.27}, {"w": "antes", "s": 51.27, "e": 51.67}, {"w": "de", "s": 51.67, "e": 51.87}, {"w": "que", "s